  "body_html": "<p>Inspire the young soccer fan in your life with this vibrant Jeminise comforter set, designed to bring the excitement of the field right into their room. This custom bedding set, featuring a dynamic soccer theme, is perfect for those who dream of soccer stardom.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Ideal for young soccer enthusiasts, inspiring them to pursue their passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> This comforter set offers customization with a name and number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Comes in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy to Use Bedding:</strong> Designed with a hidden zipper and a smooth metal pull for effortless duvet insertion and removal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques for color retention and smooth, compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat for best results.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover and two pillow shams.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Soccer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover, 2 Pillow Shams</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Text input (name &amp; number)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Full</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Width</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
